    <title>tm2219901-22_424b4 - none - 62.3283937s</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;width:775.71pt;">
    <div style="page-break-after:always; width:595.3pt;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10pt;">
      <div style="padding:0pt;margin:0pt;font-family:calibri, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:8pt;line-height:8pt;">
        <a style="text-decoration:none;color:#003366;" href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:27.85pt;margin-bottom:21.86pt;margin-left:45.65pt;width:504pt;">
        <div style="text-align:right; width:504pt; line-height:10pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8202;Filed pursuant to Rule 424(b)(4)</font>&#8203;</div>
        <div style="text-align:right; width:504pt; line-height:10pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8202;Registration No. 333-269311</font>&#8203;</div>
        <div style="text-align:center; width:504pt; line-height:19pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;font-size:18pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.45pt;">14,000,000 Ordinary Shares</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.36pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="position:relative;margin-top:9pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <img src="lg_enlight-4c.jpg" alt="[MISSING IMAGE: lg_enlight-4c.jpg]" height="61" width="191" >
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:11pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Enlight Renewable Energy Ltd. is offering 14,000,000 ordinary shares. The initial public offering price of our ordinary shares is $18.00 per share. This is our initial public offering in the United States and no public market existed in the United States for our ordinary shares prior to this offering.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.5pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Our ordinary shares trade on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange (&#8220;TASE&#8221;) under the symbol ENLT. On February&#160;2, 2023, the closing price of our ordinary shares on the TASE was NIS&#160;71.73 per share (or $20.96 based on the exchange rate reported by the Bank of Israel on February&#160;2, 2023, which was NIS&#160;3.42 to $1.00 (&#8220;BOI Exchange Rate&#8221;)).</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">We have been approved to list our ordinary shares on the Nasdaq Global Select Market (&#8220;Nasdaq&#8221;) under the symbol &#8220;ENLT.&#8221;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.5pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">We are both an &#8220;emerging growth company&#8221; and a &#8220;foreign private issuer&#8221; as defined under the U.S. federal securities laws and, as such, may elect to comply with certain reduced public company reporting requirements for future filings. See &#8220;Summary&#8212;Implications of Being an Emerging Growth Company and a Foreign Private Issuer.&#8221;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.5pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">BNP Paribas Energy Transition Fund (&#8220;BNPP ET&#8221;) has indicated an interest in purchasing an aggregate of up to $25 million of ordinary shares in this offering at the initial public offering price. Because this indication of interest is not a binding agreement or a commitment to purchase, BNPP ET could determine to purchase more, fewer or no ordinary shares in this offering, or the underwriters could determine to sell more, fewer or no ordinary shares to BNPP ET. The underwriters will receive the same discount on any of the ordinary shares purchased by BNPP ET as they will on any other ordinary shares sold to the public in this offering.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.5pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Investing in our ordinary shares involves risks and uncertainties. See &#8220;Risk Factors&#8221; beginning on page <a href="#tRIFA">21</a>.</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:9.5pt; text-align:center; width:504pt;">
          <div style="margin-left: 39.286%; margin-right: 39.286%; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:13pt; width:504pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">PRICE $18.00 PER ORDINARY SHARE</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
