            <font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Figure 2: Significant outperformance relative to S&amp;P 500 and S&amp;P renewables index</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="position:relative;margin-top:9.1pt; text-align:center; width:456pt;">
            <img src="tm2219901d10-lc_02figure4c.jpg" alt="[MISSING IMAGE: tm2219901d10-lc_02figure4c.jpg]" height="245" width="548" >
