          <div style="margin-top:6.7pt; width:456pt;">
            <div style="margin-left: 0pt; width: 108pt; margin-top: 0pt; font-size: 1pt; line-height: 0pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; ">&#8203;</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:5.6pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">Source: FactSet (as of September&#160;30, 2022)</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.3pt;">Our portfolio</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.24pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">We classify our projects into three categories:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
            <br >
          </div>
          <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
            <!--blacklining:none;-->
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Development Projects, which includes projects in various stages of development that are not expected to commence construction within 24&#160;months of the Approval Date;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
            <br >
          </div>
          <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
            <!--blacklining:none;-->
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Advanced Development Projects, which includes projects that are expected to commence construction within 13 to 24&#160;months of the Approval Date; and</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
            <br >
          </div>
          <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
            <!--blacklining:none;-->
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Mature Projects, which includes projects that are operational, under construction, in pre-construction (meaning, that such projects are expected to commence construction within 12&#160;months of the Approval Date) or have a signed PPA.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">These three categories are sequential and reflect the progression from being categorized first as a Development Project, then an Advanced Development Project and finally a Mature Project.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.3pt;">Overview of our consolidated portfolio of projects as of the Approval Date</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.24pt;"> </font>
          </div>
