          <div style="margin-top:6.12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">As discussed elsewhere in this prospectus, information regarding our projects is presented as of the Approval Date, except as otherwise specified. The following is a summary of events that occurred in December&#160;2022:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
