            <!--blacklining:none;-->
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">We completed the Parasol Projects Acquisition (as defined below) and, as a result, we acquired the vast majority of the Parasol projects that we did not acquire in connection with the Cl</font><font style="font-family:Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.1pt;">&#275;</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">nera Acquisition. With an </font>
