          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">negotiating development agreements, public benefit agreements and other agreements to compensate local governments for project impacts;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
