          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">negotiating tax abatement and incentive agreements, whenever applicable;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
