          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">obtaining financing, including debt, equity, and tax equity financing;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.2pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
