        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">price and volume fluctuations in the overall stock market;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">volatility in the market price and trading volume of companies in our industry or companies that investors consider comparable;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
