          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">changes to existing renewable energy industry policies and regulations that present technical, regulatory and economic barriers to renewable energy projects;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
