        <div style="margin-top:1.9pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">* Based on the exchange rate reported by the Bank of Israel on September 30, 2022, which was NIS 3.54 to US$1.00.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:11pt;font-style:italic;">
          <font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Debentures (Series&#160;E)</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">In June&#160;2018, we issued NIS 135,000,000 (or approximately $38.1&#160;million) (the &#8220;Series&#160;E Debentures&#8221;) par value of debentures, along with 30,375,000 options (Series&#160;2). All of the unexercised options have expired as of September&#160;30, 2022. The Series&#160;E debentures were issued under certain terms, including, but not limited to, the following terms:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;E Debentures are not linked to any index or currency;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;E Debentures are repayable in 13 payments, including 12 semi-annual payments, each at a rate of 3.5% of the principal amount and an additional payment, at a rate of 58.0% of the principal amount, which will be paid on March&#160;1, 2025;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;E Debentures bear a fixed annual interest to be paid semi-annually, in March and September of each of the&#160;years 2018 to 2025 (inclusive). The Series&#160;E Debentures effective interest rate is approximately 4.4%;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;E Debentures is not secured by any collateral or other security; and</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">so long as the Series&#160;E Debentures remain outstanding, we are required to meet the following financial covenants:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
      </div>
