          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">we will not perform any distribution except subject to the cumulative conditions specified in the trust deed of the debentures.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">As of September&#160;30, 2022, the remaining principal balance for payment in respect of the Series&#160;E Debentures was approximately $27&#160;million.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:11pt;font-style:italic;">
