        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">In June&#160;2019, April&#160;2020 and August&#160;2020, we issued NIS 222,000,000 (or approximately $62.7 million), NIS 101,010,101(or approximately $28.5 million) and NIS 234,860,000 (or approximately $66.3&#160;million) par value of debentures respectively (the &#8220;Series&#160;F Debentures&#8221;). The Series&#160;F debentures were issued under certain terms, including, but not limited to, the following terms:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
