        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;F Debentures bear a fixed annual interest to be paid semi-annually, in March and September of each of the&#160;years 2019 to 2026 (inclusive). The Series&#160;F Debentures weighted average effective interest rate is approximately 3.1%;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
