          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">As of September&#160;30, 2022, the remaining principal balance for payment in respect of the Series&#160;F Debentures was approximately $124&#160;million.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
