        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">In July&#160;2021 and March&#160;2022, respectively, we issued NIS 367,220,000 (or approximately $103.7 million) and NIS 164,363,000 (or approximately $46.4 million) par value of debentures respectively (the &#8220;Series&#160;C Debentures&#8221;). The Series&#160;C debentures were issued under certain terms, including, but not limited to, the following terms:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:5.71pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
