        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:5.7pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the unpaid principal balance of the Series&#160;C Debentures is convertible into ordinary shares, according to the following schedule: from the date of listing of the Series&#160;C Debentures on the TASE and until December&#160;31, 2023, each NIS 9.0 (or approximately $2.50) par value of the Series&#160;C Debentures will be convertible into one of our ordinary shares; and (ii)&#160;from January&#160;1, 2024 to August&#160;22, 2028, each NIS 24.0 (or approximately $6.80) par value of the Series&#160;C Debentures will be convertible into one of our ordinary shares;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
