        <div style=" line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;D Debentures are repayable two payments, each at a rate of 50% of the principal amount, on September&#160;1, 2027 and 2029;</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
