          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;D Debentures bear a fixed annual interest of 1.5%, to be paid semi-annually, in March and September of each of the&#160;years 2021 to 2029 (inclusive);</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
