          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the Series&#160;D Debentures is not secured by any collateral or other security; and</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:8pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">so long as the Series&#160;D Debentures remain outstanding, we are required to meet the following financial covenants:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:18pt; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:26pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">equity according to our financial statements (audited or reviewed) will not be less than NIS 1,250&#160;million (approximately $353.1&#160;million);</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:18pt; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:26pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the ratio between standalone net financial debt and net cap will not exceed 65% during two consecutive financial statements (audited or reviewed);</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:18pt; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:26pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the ratio of net financial debt (consolidated) to EBITDA (as defined in the indenture) as of the calculation date (if any) will not exceed 15 during more than two consecutive financial statements (audited or reviewed); </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:18pt; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:13pt; text-align:left; margin-left:26pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the equity to total balance sheet ratio in our standalone reports will be no less than 25% during two consecutive financial statements (audited or reviewed);</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:18pt; line-height:13pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:8pt;white-space:nowrap;">
