          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(1) The figures in this chart are rounded to whole numbers or the nearest hundredth decimal, as applicable.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
