          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">the recent market prices of, and demand for, publicly traded ordinary shares of generally comparable companies; and</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
