      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Pursuant to section 3A.3 of National Instrument 33-105 Underwriting Conflicts (the &#8220;NI 33-105&#8221;), the underwriters are not required to comply with the disclosure requirements of NI 33-105 regarding underwriter conflicts of interest in connection with this offering.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
