        <div style="margin-top:11.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.3pt;">Annex C&#8212;Material Non-Cash Investing and Financing Activities</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.24pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">In 2021, the Company was engaged in the construction of wind projects in Sweden, Kosovo and Spain, and in the construction of the wind project Ruach Beresheet in Israel. The Company was also engaged in the development of projects in the United States, of which a total of approximately USD 17.6&#160;million, USD 15.8&#160;million, USD&#160;5.8&#160;million, USD 1.3&#160;million and USD 1.3&#160;million, accordingly, were financed through supplier credit.</font>
        </div>
      </div>
