          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(A) Ruach Harduf&#8212;Enlight L.P. is entirely held by the Company, and holds 50.2% of the interests in Karmey Haruah Partnership, which was formed for the production of electricity from wind energy.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
