        <div style="margin-top:2.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(C) The Company, through Co-Op, holds 33.3% of the shares of Serbia 2, which was formed for the production of electricity from wind energy.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:2.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(D) The Company holds, through Enlight EU, a 51% direct stake in Bjorn, and 5.2% indirectly through PGEIF. The Company was initially consolidated in 2021. For additional details, see Note 30 A (11).</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
