        <div style="margin-top:2pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(1) A total of approximately USD 24&#160;million out of the additions applies to the capitalization of borrowing costs which arose from the construction of the qualifying assets period (2020: approximately USD 11&#160;million).</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:2.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(2) Deferred costs, mostly in respect of Ruach Beresheet wind project, were classified to fixed assets.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:2.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.188pt;">(3) In May&#160;2021 the Company initially consolidated the Bjorn project (Sweden) at a total cost of approximately USD 114&#160;million (2020: consolidation of GECAMA Spain).</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.15pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">(A)</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.25pt;"> </font><font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Solar systems</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Presented below is a review of the projects which are included under the item for fixed assets, under solar systems, as of the reporting date (*):</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <table style="width:456pt;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:11pt;border-collapse: collapse;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;">
          <tr style="line-height:11pt;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;">
            <td style="border-bottom:1px solid #000000;padding:0pt 0pt 1.833pt 0pt; width:101pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.225pt;">Electricity production </font>
              <br >
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.225pt;">projects </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="border-bottom:1px solid #000000;padding:0pt 0pt 1.833pt 0pt; width:76.75pt;">
              <div style="white-space:nowrap;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.225pt;">Zayit Yarok </font>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
