          </tr>
          <tr style="line-height:10.77pt;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;">
            <td style="padding:2.34pt 0pt 1.77pt 0pt; width:108.75pt;white-space:normal;">
              <div style="line-height:10.78pt;font-weight:bold;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.225pt;">Reference to additional information</font>
