        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Interest rate risk is due to loans bearing variable interest rates, which expose the Company to cash flow risk.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
