      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.3pt;">Note 28&#8212;O</font><font style="text-transform:lowercase;letter-spacing:0.3pt;">perating Segments</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.24pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:7.41pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">A. General</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Operating segments are identified based on the internal reports regarding the components of the Company, which are routinely reviewed by the Group&#8217;s Chief Operational Decision Maker for the purpose of allocating resource and assessing the performance of operating segments. The set of reports which are submitted to the Group&#8217;s Chief Operating Decision Maker, for the purpose of allocating resources and assessing the performance of operating resources, is based on an evaluation of certain solar power systems located in Israel as fixed asset items, which generate electricity revenues, and not as a contract asset under concession arrangement.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Presented below are details regarding the Company&#8217;s operating segments, in accordance with IFRS 8:</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <table style="width:456pt;height:187pt;margin-top:11pt;border-collapse: collapse;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10pt;">
          <tr style="line-height:12pt;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10pt;">
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:0pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt; width:161pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Israel segment </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt; width:12pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">&#8212;</font>
