            <td style="padding:2.167pt 0pt 0.833pt 0pt; width:259pt;white-space:normal;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">Produces its revenue from the sale of the electricity which is produced through wind energy and solar energy in countries of Central-Eastern Europe, mostly at fixed tariffs over extended periods. </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:0pt;">&#8203;</td>
