        <div style="margin-top:7.8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">The results of the segments are measured based on the Company&#8217;s segment adjusted EBITDA which is the Operating Profit adjusted to add the Financial Asset repayments, depreciation and amortization, U.S. acquisition expense, and share-based compensation expenses attributed to the Company&#8217;s reportable segments.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
