        <div style="margin-top:7.01pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">The results of the segments are measured based on the Company&#8217;s segment adjusted EBITDA which is the Operating Profit adjusted to add the Financial Asset Payments, depreciation and amortization, non-recurring acquisition expense, and share-based compensation expenses attributed to the Company&#8217;s reportable segments.</font><font style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.25pt;">B. Segmental revenues and results:</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <table style="width:456pt;margin-top:11pt;border-collapse: collapse;border-top:2pt solid #000000; border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000; font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;">
          <tr style="line-height:9pt;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Arial Narrow, Arial, Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:9pt;">
            <td style="border-bottom:1px solid #FFFFFF;padding:0pt 0pt 0.5pt 0pt; width:113.85pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #FFFFFF; width:3.5pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000; width:3.5pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="border-bottom:1px solid #000000;padding:2.5pt 0.5pt 2.417pt 0pt; width:0pt;text-align:right;" colspan="40">
              <div style="white-space:nowrap; text-align:right;">
                <font style="letter-spacing:0.225pt;">For the nine&#160;months period ended September&#160;30, 2022 (unaudited)</font>
              </div>
            </td>
